abstract: >-
  Open, reproducible prototype linking task-level AI exposure, adoption, Monte-Carlo impact scenarios to 2030
  (productivity, employment, value added) and an AI risk taxonomy aligned with the EU AI Act, DORA and FSB
  vulnerabilities, for Luxembourg's financial sector.
